    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the professional stuff doesn't change the reality though. it doesn't change the fact that my life is actually over. the career, my reputation, my friends... it's all gone. there's nothing left to even try and fix. i just feel like i'm performing a role in a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
